    "body": "- WordPress 4.9.6\n- WP Rocket 3.0.5-beta1\n- EU Cookie Law 3.0.1\n\nEU Cookie Law set up with default settings, only checked the _Activate_ option.\n\nCookie message gets added on the front-end; **should go away after a click on the _Ok_ button, but doesn’t.**\n\nActivating the _Auto Block_ option in EU Cookie Law fixes the issue. However, since we say WP Rocket supports this third-party plugin, we should fix this on our end.",
